{
  "schema": "quantum-tunnelling-voice-aligned-subtitles-v2",
  "fps": 60,
  "timeline_frame_start": 0,
  "voice1_frames": [
    0,
    2668
  ],
  "inter_voice_gap_frames": [
    2669,
    2768
  ],
  "voice2_start_frame": 2769,
  "cue_count": 71,
  "cues": [
    {
      "text": "核聚变，",
      "end_frame": 60,
      "visual_note": "读完就开始转场太阳了，而且你现在底下微弱的太阳根本看不见，要有淡黄色，而且太阳不要后面才加载，转场过程会有一小段一片黑",
      "index": 1,
      "start_frame": 21,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 61,
      "start_timecode": "00:00:00,350",
      "end_timecode": "00:00:01,017"
    },
    {
      "text": "是人类突破性的物理成就。",
      "end_frame": 177,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 2,
      "start_frame": 61,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 178,
      "start_timecode": "00:00:01,017",
      "end_timecode": "00:00:02,967"
    },
    {
      "text": "而太阳46亿年来散发的辐射，",
      "end_frame": 350,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 3,
      "start_frame": 192,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 351,
      "start_timecode": "00:00:03,200",
      "end_timecode": "00:00:05,850"
    },
    {
      "text": "正是核聚变在其中不断反应的产物。",
      "end_frame": 542,
      "visual_note": "转场",
      "index": 4,
      "start_frame": 376,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 543,
      "start_timecode": "00:00:06,267",
      "end_timecode": "00:00:09,050"
    },
    {
      "text": "然而根据物理学家们计算，",
      "end_frame": 680,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 5,
      "start_frame": 570,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 681,
      "start_timecode": "00:00:09,500",
      "end_timecode": "00:00:11,350"
    },
    {
      "text": "太阳中心温度约为1500万开，",
      "end_frame": 858,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 6,
      "start_frame": 698,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 859,
      "start_timecode": "00:00:11,633",
      "end_timecode": "00:00:14,317"
    },
    {
      "text": "远远低于经典估算核聚变反应至少所需的温度，",
      "end_frame": 1106,
      "visual_note": "上方温度条开始",
      "index": 7,
      "start_frame": 882,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1107,
      "start_timecode": "00:00:14,700",
      "end_timecode": "00:00:18,450"
    },
    {
      "text": "一亿。",
      "end_frame": 1171,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 8,
      "start_frame": 1133,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1172,
      "start_timecode": "00:00:18,883",
      "end_timecode": "00:00:19,533"
    },
    {
      "text": "这个问题先考虑核聚变的实质。",
      "end_frame": 1327,
      "visual_note": "F01250开始转场",
      "index": 9,
      "start_frame": 1187,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1328,
      "start_timecode": "00:00:19,783",
      "end_timecode": "00:00:22,133"
    },
    {
      "text": "轻原子核克服库仑斥力、聚合并释放能量，",
      "end_frame": 1575,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 10,
      "start_frame": 1352,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1576,
      "start_timecode": "00:00:22,533",
      "end_timecode": "00:00:26,267"
    },
    {
      "text": "而温度表示轻核子携带的能量。",
      "end_frame": 1740,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 11,
      "start_frame": 1597,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1741,
      "start_timecode": "00:00:26,617",
      "end_timecode": "00:00:29,017"
    },
    {
      "text": "根据经典电磁理论，",
      "end_frame": 1835,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 12,
      "start_frame": 1754,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1836,
      "start_timecode": "00:00:29,233",
      "end_timecode": "00:00:30,600"
    },
    {
      "text": "核携带能量克服库仑力做功，",
      "end_frame": 1984,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 13,
      "start_frame": 1860,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1985,
      "start_timecode": "00:00:31,000",
      "end_timecode": "00:00:33,083"
    },
    {
      "text": "而太阳目前的温度只能到这。",
      "end_frame": 2134,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 14,
      "start_frame": 2006,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 2135,
      "start_timecode": "00:00:33,433",
      "end_timecode": "00:00:35,583"
    },
    {
      "text": "该理论下太阳无法发生核聚变。",
      "end_frame": 2303,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 15,
      "start_frame": 2147,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 2304,
      "start_timecode": "00:00:35,783",
      "end_timecode": "00:00:38,400"
    },
    {
      "text": "然而太阳依旧燃烧，",
      "end_frame": 2417,
      "visual_note": "转场到问号",
      "index": 16,
      "start_frame": 2321,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 2418,
      "start_timecode": "00:00:38,683",
      "end_timecode": "00:00:40,300"
    },
    {
      "text": "明显是我们的理论有所遗漏，",
      "end_frame": 2582,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 17,
      "start_frame": 2450,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 2583,
      "start_timecode": "00:00:40,833",
      "end_timecode": "00:00:43,050"
    },
    {
      "text": "而这就是",
      "end_frame": 2643,
      "visual_note": "F02640转场",
      "index": 18,
      "start_frame": 2598,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 2644,
      "start_timecode": "00:00:43,300",
      "end_timecode": "00:00:44,067"
    },
    {
      "text": "不确定原理是量子力学研究的基本特性",
      "end_frame": 2947,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 19,
      "start_frame": 2791,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 2948,
      "start_timecode": "00:00:46,517",
      "end_timecode": "00:00:49,133"
    },
    {
      "text": "它是量子力学的核心推论",
      "end_frame": 3065,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 20,
      "start_frame": 2955,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 3066,
      "start_timecode": "00:00:49,250",
      "end_timecode": "00:00:51,100"
    },
    {
      "text": "源于位置与动量算符的不对易，",
      "end_frame": 3208,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 21,
      "start_frame": 3083,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 3209,
      "start_timecode": "00:00:51,383",
      "end_timecode": "00:00:53,483"
    },
    {
      "text": "波函数的统计诠释，",
      "end_frame": 3314,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 22,
      "start_frame": 3229,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 3315,
      "start_timecode": "00:00:53,817",
      "end_timecode": "00:00:55,250"
    },
    {
      "text": "则赋予其中标准差以测量分布的物理意义。",
      "end_frame": 3503,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 23,
      "start_frame": 3315,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 3504,
      "start_timecode": "00:00:55,250",
      "end_timecode": "00:00:58,400"
    },
    {
      "text": "在这个式子中我们可以发现，",
      "end_frame": 3635,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 24,
      "start_frame": 3523,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 3636,
      "start_timecode": "00:00:58,717",
      "end_timecode": "00:01:00,600"
    },
    {
      "text": "动量和位置的不确定度无法同时被限制在极小的范围内。",
      "end_frame": 3877,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 25,
      "start_frame": 3655,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 3878,
      "start_timecode": "00:01:00,917",
      "end_timecode": "00:01:04,633"
    },
    {
      "text": "因此一个携带着能量的电子",
      "end_frame": 4060,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 26,
      "start_frame": 3943,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 4061,
      "start_timecode": "00:01:05,717",
      "end_timecode": "00:01:07,683"
    },
    {
      "text": "在宏观中我们视其为一个“点”或“小球”的粒子模型",
      "end_frame": 4256,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 27,
      "start_frame": 4067,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 4257,
      "start_timecode": "00:01:07,783",
      "end_timecode": "00:01:10,950"
    },
    {
      "text": "而在足够微观时",
      "end_frame": 4335,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 28,
      "start_frame": 4271,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 4336,
      "start_timecode": "00:01:11,183",
      "end_timecode": "00:01:12,267"
    },
    {
      "text": "就需要当作量子态来研究",
      "end_frame": 4447,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 29,
      "start_frame": 4357,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 4448,
      "start_timecode": "00:01:12,617",
      "end_timecode": "00:01:14,133"
    },
    {
      "text": "波包就是其中一种可用描述形式",
      "end_frame": 4593,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 30,
      "start_frame": 4448,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 4594,
      "start_timecode": "00:01:14,133",
      "end_timecode": "00:01:16,567"
    },
    {
      "text": "我们可以用波函数描述它的状态",
      "end_frame": 4740,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 31,
      "start_frame": 4612,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 4741,
      "start_timecode": "00:01:16,867",
      "end_timecode": "00:01:19,017"
    },
    {
      "text": "波函数的模方就是量子态下的概率密度分布",
      "end_frame": 4946,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 32,
      "start_frame": 4751,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 4947,
      "start_timecode": "00:01:19,183",
      "end_timecode": "00:01:22,450"
    },
    {
      "text": "利用薛定谔方程可以推导出给定条件下的波函数",
      "end_frame": 5201,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 33,
      "start_frame": 4947,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 5202,
      "start_timecode": "00:01:22,450",
      "end_timecode": "00:01:26,700"
    },
    {
      "text": "其中这个“V”指代该粒子所处的“环境”（势场）",
      "end_frame": 5369,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 34,
      "start_frame": 5216,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 5370,
      "start_timecode": "00:01:26,933",
      "end_timecode": "00:01:29,500"
    },
    {
      "text": "根据条件我们可以搭建各式各样的势场。",
      "end_frame": 5539,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 35,
      "start_frame": 5389,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 5540,
      "start_timecode": "00:01:29,817",
      "end_timecode": "00:01:32,333"
    },
    {
      "text": "而这种势场就是考察量子随穿的一个简化一维模型",
      "end_frame": 5779,
      "visual_note": "## A01",
      "index": 36,
      "start_frame": 5565,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 5780,
      "start_timecode": "00:01:32,750",
      "end_timecode": "00:01:36,333"
    },
    {
      "text": "具备着势垒的厚度和高度",
      "end_frame": 5889,
      "visual_note": "## A02，## A03切掉",
      "index": 37,
      "start_frame": 5795,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 5890,
      "start_timecode": "00:01:36,583",
      "end_timecode": "00:01:38,167"
    },
    {
      "text": "粒子向着势垒方向运动，",
      "end_frame": 5975,
      "visual_note": "## A04，## A06",
      "index": 38,
      "start_frame": 5890,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 5976,
      "start_timecode": "00:01:38,167",
      "end_timecode": "00:01:39,600"
    },
    {
      "text": "在量子态下，",
      "end_frame": 6049,
      "visual_note": "## A06，## A07",
      "index": 39,
      "start_frame": 5993,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 6050,
      "start_timecode": "00:01:39,883",
      "end_timecode": "00:01:40,833"
    },
    {
      "text": "我们用波函数来描述它。",
      "end_frame": 6168,
      "visual_note": "## A08",
      "index": 40,
      "start_frame": 6068,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 6169,
      "start_timecode": "00:01:41,133",
      "end_timecode": "00:01:42,817"
    },
    {
      "text": "分为实部和虚部，",
      "end_frame": 6255,
      "visual_note": "##A09",
      "index": 41,
      "start_frame": 6185,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 6256,
      "start_timecode": "00:01:43,083",
      "end_timecode": "00:01:44,267"
    },
    {
      "text": "联立即是这种波函数绕轴旋转的形式，",
      "end_frame": 6430,
      "visual_note": "A10，A11",
      "index": 42,
      "start_frame": 6277,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 6431,
      "start_timecode": "00:01:44,617",
      "end_timecode": "00:01:47,183"
    },
    {
      "text": "也可以视为一个局域的概率波包。",
      "end_frame": 6565,
      "visual_note": "A12",
      "index": 43,
      "start_frame": 6448,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 6566,
      "start_timecode": "00:01:47,467",
      "end_timecode": "00:01:49,433"
    },
    {
      "text": "当波包接触到势垒时，",
      "end_frame": 6679,
      "visual_note": "A13",
      "index": 44,
      "start_frame": 6584,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 6680,
      "start_timecode": "00:01:49,733",
      "end_timecode": "00:01:51,333"
    },
    {
      "text": "概率波会分成两部分，",
      "end_frame": 6770,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 45,
      "start_frame": 6697,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 6771,
      "start_timecode": "00:01:51,617",
      "end_timecode": "00:01:52,850"
    },
    {
      "text": "一部分反射，一部分透射。",
      "end_frame": 6898,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 46,
      "start_frame": 6783,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 6899,
      "start_timecode": "00:01:53,050",
      "end_timecode": "00:01:54,983"
    },
    {
      "text": "根据薛定谔方程，",
      "end_frame": 6990,
      "visual_note": "A14",
      "index": 47,
      "start_frame": 6914,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 6991,
      "start_timecode": "00:01:55,233",
      "end_timecode": "00:01:56,517"
    },
    {
      "text": "波函数会分为向右传播的透射波和向左传播的反射波，",
      "end_frame": 7244,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 48,
      "start_frame": 7023,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 7245,
      "start_timecode": "00:01:57,050",
      "end_timecode": "00:02:00,750"
    },
    {
      "text": "它们与势垒两侧的传播波一起，",
      "end_frame": 7391,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 49,
      "start_frame": 7252,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 7392,
      "start_timecode": "00:02:00,867",
      "end_timecode": "00:02:03,200"
    },
    {
      "text": "满足两个边界处的连续条件，",
      "end_frame": 7524,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 50,
      "start_frame": 7409,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 7525,
      "start_timecode": "00:02:03,483",
      "end_timecode": "00:02:05,417"
    },
    {
      "text": "由此得出电子在势垒影响下的波函数，",
      "end_frame": 7676,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 51,
      "start_frame": 7543,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 7677,
      "start_timecode": "00:02:05,717",
      "end_timecode": "00:02:07,950"
    },
    {
      "text": "注意的是概率波分成两部分，",
      "end_frame": 7837,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 52,
      "start_frame": 7701,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 7838,
      "start_timecode": "00:02:08,350",
      "end_timecode": "00:02:10,633"
    },
    {
      "text": "进而解得透射概率，",
      "end_frame": 7935,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 53,
      "start_frame": 7861,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 7936,
      "start_timecode": "00:02:11,017",
      "end_timecode": "00:02:12,267"
    },
    {
      "text": "在厚高势垒下，就有概率约值。",
      "end_frame": 8062,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 54,
      "start_frame": 7936,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 8063,
      "start_timecode": "00:02:12,267",
      "end_timecode": "00:02:14,383"
    },
    {
      "text": "由式子可以看到，",
      "end_frame": 8171,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 55,
      "start_frame": 8101,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 8172,
      "start_timecode": "00:02:15,017",
      "end_timecode": "00:02:16,200"
    },
    {
      "text": "概率是指数衰减的，",
      "end_frame": 8253,
      "visual_note": "## A15",
      "index": 56,
      "start_frame": 8180,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 8254,
      "start_timecode": "00:02:16,333",
      "end_timecode": "00:02:17,567"
    },
    {
      "text": "而且随势垒高度变高而下降，",
      "end_frame": 8392,
      "visual_note": "A19，A20，A21",
      "index": 57,
      "start_frame": 8272,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 8393,
      "start_timecode": "00:02:17,867",
      "end_timecode": "00:02:19,883"
    },
    {
      "text": "也随势垒厚度变窄而上升。",
      "end_frame": 8505,
      "visual_note": "A16，A17，A18",
      "index": 58,
      "start_frame": 8407,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 8506,
      "start_timecode": "00:02:20,117",
      "end_timecode": "00:02:21,767"
    },
    {
      "text": "虽然概率朝两个方向流动，",
      "end_frame": 8628,
      "visual_note": "## A23",
      "index": 59,
      "start_frame": 8528,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 8629,
      "start_timecode": "00:02:22,133",
      "end_timecode": "00:02:23,817"
    },
    {
      "text": "但每次测量，只能得到一个完整的电子。",
      "end_frame": 8783,
      "visual_note": "A24",
      "index": 60,
      "start_frame": 8629,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 8784,
      "start_timecode": "00:02:23,817",
      "end_timecode": "00:02:26,400"
    },
    {
      "text": "大数粒子隧穿就从概率变成统计上的比例。",
      "end_frame": 8984,
      "visual_note": "A25",
      "index": 61,
      "start_frame": 8786,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 8985,
      "start_timecode": "00:02:26,433",
      "end_timecode": "00:02:29,750"
    },
    {
      "text": "进而形成宏观上的隧穿电流，",
      "end_frame": 9122,
      "visual_note": "## A26",
      "index": 62,
      "start_frame": 9004,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 9123,
      "start_timecode": "00:02:30,067",
      "end_timecode": "00:02:32,050"
    },
    {
      "text": "2025年的诺贝尔物理学奖就是该成果，",
      "end_frame": 9331,
      "visual_note": "",
      "index": 63,
      "start_frame": 9165,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 9332,
      "start_timecode": "00:02:32,750",
      "end_timecode": "00:02:35,533"
    },
    {
      "text": "表彰三位物理学家在电路中发现宏观量子力学隧穿效应，",
      "end_frame": 9588,
      "visual_note": "",
